card/\", \"/mnt/sdcard/\"))\n            print(f\"Line {lnum}: {p_clean} -> exists: {exists}\")\n'","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Scan all absolute paths outside code blocks"}}]}
